# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local must be gitignored.
#
# A READ-ONLY artifact feed token scoped to package read. Never a personal password: this file is
# mounted into a container that runs an agent, and a password here is a password in a process
# environment, in shell history and in any core dump.
#
# This is the single setting that decides whether the agent can run Gradle. Without it every compile
# becomes a queued command for a person to run and paste back.
REPO_USER=
REPO_TOKEN=
